    "scope 'skill' means the video is about that exact movement. scope 'family' means it covers the movement family and is attached to a one-leg or elevated variant that has no dedicated tutorial — the app labels these differently so the distinction is visible to the athlete.",
    "Adding a video: put it here, run tools/build_skills.py, then tools/check_data.py. Nothing else needs touching."
